.DS_Store
.codegraph/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# CNF and proof files are checked in the run and never committed (PROTOCOL.md §5)
*.cnf
*.drat
*.cnf.gz
*.drat.gz
research/12-faced-polyhedron/overnight/work/
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/*/results/**/*.lock
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/*/results/**/launch.pids

# Run-control markers of overnight runs (launch.sh stop); never evidence
stop.requested

# Raw per-unit output of tranche runs (attempt_*/): solver and unit logs, unit specs, maps and control inputs and
# outputs stay outside git, moved to ../polyhedrons-data by research/12-faced-polyhedron/overnight/move_raw.py.
# Git keeps the evidence (PROTOCOL.md section 5): manifests, control summaries, every unit's result.json (other
# experiments read them), every SAT model and every checker transcript.
**/attempt_*/**
!**/attempt_*/*/
!**/attempt_*/manifest.json
!**/attempt_*/controls/manifest.json
!**/attempt_*/controls/summary.json
!**/attempt_*/map*/result.json
!**/attempt_*/**/*.model.json
!**/attempt_*/**/*.checker.log
!**/attempt_*/**/*.recheck.log
# Exception: the same-path pilot is cited evidence of E-261103-03 (test_tranche checks its output hashes)
!research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261103-03-s5-exact-decision-8-2-9-3/results/coverage_pilot/**
